## Archive

The finished issues under `doc/issues/archive/`, newest first.

```hql#eval
issues
| filter(i => i.lane == "archive")
| map(i => { id: i.id, title: i.title })
| Table(columns = ["id", "title"])
| format(as = Markdown)
```
